BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (the collector must take the debt by assignment to enforce it without being accused of the unauthorized) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (practice of law, and the agreement reassigns the judgment back to the plaintiff after a year or 24 months) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm ([fjA8sRRh0ZI @ 00:10:44]. BusinessWealths pitches judgment holders on exactly that structure, charging no) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (application or upfront fees, bearing every search and enforcement expense, and taking a percentage only of) Tj ET
