BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 631.55 Tm (The first trap is mistaking a court order for money. Lance Casey, a Sacramento private investigator and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 616.32 Tm (process server, got into the business after winning a money judgment against an evicted ex-tenant, filing all) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 601.10 Tm (the paperwork with the court and sheriff, paying the filing and sheriff's fees, and not making a dime because) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 585.87 Tm (the debtor had no income or seizable assets [U_rmTsuyYV8 @ 00:00:54]. Sean Bougie hit the same wall:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 570.65 Tm (people assume the order lets you garnish wages and attach assets and the debtor will pay to get you out of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 555.42 Tm (there, but most of the time they simply wait for the judgment to fall off, unconcerned about bad credit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 540.20 Tm (because they are not in the middle of buying a house [cKgzsxKOOxs @ 00:00:52]. Cynthia Schmidt, who) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 524.97 Tm (reports collecting 90 satisfied judgments worth over 250,000, puts only 70 percent of the 19 billion in old) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 509.75 Tm (unpaid judgments in the collectible column and steers clear of being assigned the other 30 percent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 494.52 Tm ([5T2nU_IZTXs @ 00:00:43]. Even a live asset can be a mirage: Rich Meyer had a safe deposit box drilled) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 479.30 Tm (with the sheriff after a bank garnishment and found nothing but dust [fjA8sRRh0ZI @ 00:39:00].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 464.07 Tm (The second trap is the enforcement toolkit itself. Rich Meyer has run 50 to 60 wage garnishments and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 448.85 Tm (counts maybe 40 as successful, calling it poor odds because any debtor can file a head-of-household) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 433.62 Tm (affidavit, after which the creditor has three days to prove a negative, and losing means paying the debtor's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 418.40 Tm (attorney fees on top of your own [fjA8sRRh0ZI @ 00:14:40]. Worse, the debtor walks away believing they) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 403.17 Tm (beat you. Sheriff levies carry their own sting: docket a writ of execution and land eighth in line behind seven) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 387.95 Tm (earlier judgments, and your odds on real estate or a car are none, which is why Meyer insists judicial) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 372.72 Tm (execution gets rewarded while sheriff work does not [fjA8sRRh0ZI @ 00:32:49]. Sean Bougie says states) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 357.50 Tm (are passing consumer laws that make garnishing, finding assets, and attaching them darn near impossible,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 342.27 Tm (and Bougie expects that political push to continue for quite a while [ML9MBLDQFHY @ 00:00:15]. Hard Hat) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 327.05 Tm (Economics flags debt collection as a highly regulated industry where abusive, unfair, or deceptive practices) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 311.82 Tm (are illegal, including calling debtors in the middle of the night or more than seven times per week) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 296.60 Tm ([-FdK6kbQiio @ 00:05:59].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 281.37 Tm (The third trap is cash-flow timing. Evan Ross tells Judgment Business licensees to expect four to six months) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 266.15 Tm (before talking to customers and roughly six months from training to first revenue, with an average) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 250.92 Tm (eight-week collection cycle that stretches when forcing a property sale or placing a lien, and Ross admits the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 235.70 Tm (business has a real lack of predictability even if scalability is there [YqjXCyNkUZ8 @ 00:08:25]. Avi) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 220.47 Tm (Gronwald of Fair Capital, profiled by Hard Hat Economics, mailed thousands of letters personally in the early) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 205.25 Tm (days, and because collectors only earn when payments land, the opening stretch is a grind of waiting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 190.02 Tm ([-FdK6kbQiio @ 00:06:45]. Rich Meyer's payment-plan model has its own decay curve: the student Jason) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 174.80 Tm (built 5,400 dollars a month in passive income from judgments, watched it fall to about 2,200 as files ran to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 159.57 Tm (the end of the tail and paid off, and now has to refill the pipeline [fjA8sRRh0ZI @ 00:53:09]. Cross the River,) Tj ET
