BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (FDCPA [Sacramento County Public Law Library - bX8Hhszjuxs @ 00:04:28].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (When wages move too slowly, seize the debtor's business websites, email, and phone numbers as leverage) Tj ET
