BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Section 4: Firsthand Failure Modes, Traps & Economics Checks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 693.77 Tm (The most expensive failure starts before the complaint is filed. Attorney Michael Ehline's opening rule is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 678.55 Tm (blunt: don't sue without insurance or a known asset, and remember that a settlement is not a judgment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 663.32 Tm ([jPO9_I_LBSw @ 00:00:00]. Eric Nano of the Sacramento County Public Law Library warns that debtors) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (living off the grid are hard to find, and the ones who truly live that way likely have nothing worth collecting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (anyway [bX8Hhszjuxs @ 00:06:17]. Jeff Leon frames the cost side just as bluntly: weigh the cost of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (collection, especially on a contingency file, because post-judgment fees can exceed what was spent winning) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (the judgment in the first place [R3nWxu374QE @ 00:08:27]. The panel boils the whole calculation down to a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (single line: 'you don't spend a million dollars to collect half a million dollars' [R3nWxu374QE @ 00:22:53].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (That means every enforcement step needs a projected return attached before it is filed, not after the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (invoices land. The economics check is simple and unforgiving. Before spending a dollar on enforcement,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (know exactly what asset you are chasing, what it will cost to reach it, how long it will take to convert into) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (cash, and at what point the file stops being worth another hour of billable work.) Tj ET
