BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.55 Tm (The first trap is the exam itself. The Sacramento County Public Law Library warns that ordering a debtor in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.32 Tm (tips them off. Money can migrate to a different bank before the creditor moves, so levies have to follow) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.10 Tm (quickly once questioning exposes where the cash sits [HrhPbWDRBVU @ 00:05:46]. Service is the second) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.87 Tm (choke point. Fitzgerald & Campbell stress that the order must be personally served, not mailed, because the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.65 Tm (exam compels both appearance and documents showing where the debtor banks, works, lives, and what) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.42 Tm (they own [rSqWVX1naKw @ 00:00:25]. People Locator Skip Tracing treats current address information from) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.20 Tm (a professional skip trace as a prerequisite to landing that service at all [leX2BIpiyNQ @ 00:00:33].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 380.97 Tm (Courtroom 1401 at the Daley Center spells out what a sloppy packet costs. Incorrect service means) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.75 Tm (re-service, and the citation stays inactive until it is served. A failed personal service requires an alias citation,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.52 Tm (and an unserved citation cannot be continued, so a continuance order is wasted paper [RHS2h5dUkHk @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.30 Tm (00:04:15]. The same courtroom denies relief to anyone ignoring its standing orders and requires) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.07 Tm (Attachments A and E inside the served packet. Every week lost to a bad address or a defective packet) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.85 Tm (hands the debtor another week to reposition money.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.62 Tm (The second trap is a question worded too narrowly. On AceOfCoins, an advisor coaches a caller who) Tj ET
