BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 243.95 Tm (it' [3qP0K9KK5G8 @ 00:03:37]. The same advisor recommends adding a family member to turn the entity) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 228.72 Tm (into a 'nominee LLC,' so a creditor's writ reaches only the caller's distributions [3qP0K9KK5G8 @ 00:04:56].) Tj ET
