BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (off, and he labels that habit something that should be malpractice; his method is to answer roughly 80) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (percent of the questions from records first, then ask only the remaining 20 percent under oath so any false) Tj ET
