BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm ([njrU1ZwxRCY @ 00:00:57], and LawShelf limits coverage to personal, family, or household debts such as) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (cars, credit cards, and some student loans, with commercial debt excluded and attorneys who regularly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (collect pulled inside [i6PAssklgJg @ 00:01:24]. Jeff Loman of Guardian Litigation Group sharpens the edge) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (for street use: banks, payday lenders, rent-a-centers, and tolls sit outside, and business debt never qualifies) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm ([n3SZjPQDSHc @ 00:04:20]. The perimeter is wider than debt buyers want it to be. John Watts walks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (through Barbato v. Crown Asset, where the buyer argued it merely purchased charged-off receivables and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (farmed collection out; the court held that an entity meeting the principal-purpose definition cannot dodge the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (Act by hiring a third party to do its collecting [fPw38bPWFtw @ 00:02:40]. Watts frames the economics that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (make buyers fight so hard: Crown buys a thousand-dollar debt for fifty bucks and the consumer may settle) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (for $700. For an operator, the first screening question is therefore who is actually collecting, what kind of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (debt it is, and whose business model depends on the payment.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (The contact rules form the second layer of agreement. Attorney Kaiser Jansen, on SeniorLiving.Org, states) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (the Reg F line bluntly: collectors can only attempt to call seven times in seven days, and after a connection) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (only one contact per seven-day period, counted per account, so five accounts can mean up to 35 calls) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm ([9RtU4rpS3pw @ 00:05:51]. Jansen also warns that saying 'okay' to a callback counts as consent.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (WealthCurve adds the clock window shared by nearly every speaker: no calls before 8:00 a.m. or after 9:00) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (p.m., plus bans on threats, impersonation, and unauthorized fees [cKYmFnf_o2Q @ 00:03:43]. Workplace) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (contact runs on notice. Loman says calls at work are allowed until the consumer tells the collector personal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (calls cannot be received there, and any call after that is a violation [n3SZjPQDSHc @ 00:20:44]. Digital) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (channels carry their own trap for collectors. Night Ferry notes texts and emails are not counted toward the) Tj ET
