BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Loman says a disputed collector tradeline must be marked disputed [Solo - Resolve Your Debt -) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (n3SZjPQDSHc @ 00:14:16].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (Step: 4) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (Title: Audit the balance and plan the filing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (Action: Match every charge to the contract, then file expecting removal and a motion to dismiss.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (Detail: Parker treats an unauthorized 25% collection fee as a ?1692f violation [KillDebt & ParkerGPT: The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (New Way To Law - YYdsx06msa0 @ 00:03:38]; Watts files in state court and expects removal 99.9 percent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (of the time [Alabama Consumer Protection Lawyers - Ce0D7z4zJFo @ 00:00:30].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (Aaron Swift's bronze-tier case is the cleanest street workflow on record, the 'blocking and tackling' files that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (keep the lights on. Intake filters each consumer into litigation, disputes, or a credit-repair affiliate partner,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (then the firm sends third-party collectors a letter by fax or email [owpVxkqEbEk @ 00:03:10]. Swift stresses) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (it is not a validation letter, which only matters inside the first 30 days; it is built on Reg F, restricts contact) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (channels and times such as 5:00 to 8:00 p.m., and disputes the debt. The trap then springs on its own. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (collector kept texting, and the credit reports never marked the account disputed. Loman confirms the second) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (hook: when a collector tradeline such as LVNV or Portfolio Recovery is disputed, it must be marked disputed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm ([n3SZjPQDSHc @ 00:14:16]. Swift's payout on those two technical violations: about $4,000 of debt forgiven,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (the tradeline deleted, $1,000 in statutory damages, roughly $4,500 in attorney fees, and about $450 to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (affiliate as contract paralegal [owpVxkqEbEk @ 00:05:22]. Swift calls the result a debt almost completely) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (erased like it never existed. The unit economics are the point. A low-dollar file with a fax letter and two) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (missed obligations funds the attorney, the affiliate, and a near-total debt wipe for the client.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (Once a file goes to suit, John Watts lays out the procedural rhythm. He files in state court 99.9 percent of the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (time because of Spokeo standing arguments, and defendants, who get 30 days to answer or remove,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (remove 99.9 percent of the time [Ce0D7z4zJFo @ 00:00:30]. Motions to dismiss are often baseless) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (because 'it makes the lawyers money,' so he usually amends the complaint as of right instead. Discovery) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (then runs through interrogatories, document requests, requests for admission, and depositions, followed by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (summary judgment with damages usually left to the jury [Ce0D7z4zJFo @ 00:03:32]. At trial he calls the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (collector's own witnesses, and the collector's motion for judgment as a matter of law has always been) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (denied in his trials. Swift tempers the trial math: the vast majority, 99 percent or more, never reach trial) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm ([owpVxkqEbEk @ 00:01:14]. Brian Parker shows what discovery can surface on the other side. Deposing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (collection attorney Bradley Johnson, he extracted that the firm files about 50 suits a week, roughly 10 a day,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (off a form complaint with an auto-generated summons, scrubbing through LexisNexis for deceased, new) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (addresses, bankruptcy, and active military [RwXTJhX-rxo @ 00:21:52]. Volume filing on templates is exactly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (what deposition questioning is built to expose.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (The balance itself is the next attack surface. Loman's hospital-debt workflow starts with a HIPAA request for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.35 Tm (medical records including billing, because the collector is not required to itemize under 'G' of the FDCPA,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 176.12 Tm (then pulls an insurance accounting of what was paid; he routinely finds double billing and code changes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 160.90 Tm ([n3SZjPQDSHc @ 00:41:14]. Host Hannah Locklear was charged $16 for one ibuprofen pill and got the debt) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 145.67 Tm (lowered after demanding an itemized statement, and Loman has a client billed $6,000 for a $300 IV. Brian) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 130.45 Tm (Parker hunts the same inflation through ?1692f: every charge must sit inside the four corners of the contract,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 115.22 Tm (and an unauthorized 25% collection fee is a violation [YYdsx06msa0 @ 00:03:38]. He also stacks claims,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 100.00 Tm (since false credit reporting under ?1692e8 supports an FCRA claim too, so 'you can hit them twice') Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 84.77 Tm ([YYdsx06msa0 @ 00:01:13]. Parker frames these as strict-liability violations. None of this works without) Tj ET
