BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (The Practitioner Consensus: Judgments Outlive the Debt, and the Clock Only Helps People Who Track It) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 693.77 Tm (Across the asset-protection, credit-repair, and consumer-defense camps, operators agree on one baseline) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 678.55 Tm (fact: a judgment is a far longer-lived weapon than the underlying debt. The Business Guy of Asset) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 663.32 Tm (Protection Planners puts the general lifespan at 10 to 20 years, with some states letting judgments run for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (the rest of the debtor's life [nbtlIEi4we0 @ 00:00:00]. Their state examples are blunt. California runs 10) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (years, renewable for another 10. Oklahoma expires in five years but lets the creditor renew every five years) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (indefinitely, and each renewal restarts the clock [nbtlIEi4we0 @ 00:02:28]. Weston Legal draws the same) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (contrast from the lawsuit side: creditors typically get 4, 5, or 6 years to sue, but a judgment they win can last) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (20 years in many states [HD3idZhyATA @ 00:00:48]. Stephen A Williams of The Credit Repair Shop frames) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (the outer wall as a 20-year maximum on civil judgments, outside student loans. Inside that window, each) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (state has a dormancy mechanism that kills renewal if the holder sleeps past its date [--FOsBTlu2E @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (00:03:32]. The takeaway is consistent: an old debt and a dead judgment are different animals. The date that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (matters is the renewal or revival deadline in the specific state.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (The second point of agreement kills a popular street myth: dodging the process server or waiting out the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (calendar after a suit is filed does nothing. Steve Richardson, a collection defense attorney in southern New) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (Jersey, says a question they field constantly comes from people whose bank accounts are being levied on a) Tj ET
