BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (statute of limitations no longer applies [wibZgw9EKZ4 @ 00:00:27]. Richardson's New Jersey numbers for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm (the pre-suit window are four years for sale of goods and six years for services and credit card balances,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (running from charge-off [wibZgw9EKZ4 @ 00:01:25]. Weston Legal hits the service angle directly. People try) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (to avoid the process server until the limitations period runs, but the clock stops when the lawsuit is filed, not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm (when the defendant is served [HD3idZhyATA @ 00:00:34]. John Skiba of Consumer Warrior supplies the flip) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (side, the one window where the limitations clock is a live weapon. If the creditor filed after expiration, such) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (as past Arizona's six-year credit card period, the defendant can move to dismiss [7TbwIGMYgYE @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (00:02:26]. Timing defenses live before filing; after judgment, the fight moves to enforcement, renewal, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (assets.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (The third consensus is that the debtor who disengages hands the creditor the win. Skiba reports that about) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (95% of people sued by a debt collector never file an answer. Without an answer the game is over: judgment,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (then wage garnishment or a bank levy [fWHpyqQu_5M @ 00:01:13]. The Business Guy adds a mechanical) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (nuance that cuts both ways. A judgment does not force the debtor to start paying; the creditor has to act) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (under state law to seize assets. Failure to pay is not punishable by contempt or jail, outside exceptions like) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (child or spousal support [5mmy9Xz_Oko @ 00:00:58]. That passivity is exactly what revivers exploit.) Tj ET
